# Play test of Highpine Island (CIPlay highpine_island): no quest - the path up the west peak, the rope bridge to the
# east peak and its cache, the zipline's end, the cabin, the pier, the wreck, the den, the monsters
island Highpine Island
offset 0 0
expect animals Bear 1
expect animals Hyena 3
expect animals Screecher 2
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5
where BalboaCave
kill Hyena
kill Screecher
walk -66 30 to -50 30 to -36 30 to -26 30 h=24
read Bridge sign
walk -15 30 to -9 30 to 0 30 to 9 30 to 15 30 h=24
open Lookout's cache
expect item Leather 3
walk -49.75 -38 to -47.75 -35.5 to -47.75 -32.5 h=4.1
read The woodcutter's book
open Woodcutter's chest
open Barrel by the cabin
walk 30 -76 to 30 -82 to 30 -90 to 30 -97 h=1.8
open Barrel at the pier
open Barrel by the wreck
open Bear den hoard
expect hidden vinechest
dig
kill Bear
kill Warthog
expect animals Bear 0
expect animals Hyena 0
